    "content": "<p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"1\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:1\" class=\"v\">1</span>Behold now bless ye the Lord, all ye servants of the Lord: Who stand in the house of the Lord, in the courts of the house of our God.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"2\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:2\" class=\"v\">2</span>In the nights lift up your hands to the holy places, and bless ye the Lord.</p><p class=\"q1\"><span data-number=\"3\" data-sid=\"PSA 133:3\" class=\"v\">3</span>May the Lord out of Sion bless thee, he that made heaven and earth.</p>",
